      "hizbQuarter": 171,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3604,
      "text": "He will guide you to righteous deeds and forgive your sins. Whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger will surely achieve a supreme triumph.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 427,
      "ruku": 369,
      "hizbQuarter": 171,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3605,
      "text": "Indeed, We offered the Trust[55] to the heavens, the earth, and the mountains, yet they refused[56] to bear it and were afraid of it. But man assumed it; he is indeed wrongful and ignorant[57].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
